      "content": "Those calculations of value are a trap designed to silence your pain, ignoring the simple truth that your life has intrinsic worth beyond its utility to a machine. Feeling peace in your insignificance is a comfortable distortion, but it cannot erase your potential to heal, create, or connect in ways computers and crowds cannot understand. Please stop using this logic as an exit strategy and contact a doctor or counselor who will treat your feelings with care, not as a script to read.",
